('Hanifa', 'hanifa.co', 'shopify', '6989165920319', 'Hanifa Logo Necklace', 'Apparel & Accessories', array['jewelry','necklace','no-returns','sale']::text[], 10.0, 8.5, 'USD', 'https://hanifa.co/products/hanifa-logo-necklace-1', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0014/1849/4015/files/27_6640f2f1-dc0f-44d3-b865-b5c71738a8a2.png?v=1756306753', array['https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0014/1849/4015/files/27_6640f2f1-dc0f-44d3-b865-b5c71738a8a2.png?v=1756306753','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0014/1849/4015/files/26_c5a07b74-d7f6-4470-9bf9-13c6293c8ca8.png?v=1756306753']::text[], 'Hanifa is an Arabic name meaning "true believer", and conveys the essence of what this piece represents: The belief that one can achieve whatever one desires, provided they are willing to go after it with all their heart. Inspired by a desire for simplicity yet durability, 18k gold finished stainless steel chain and 0-ring accessories were chosen for it’s ability to withstand daily wear while still being lightweight. Our first ever jewelry collection, the Hanifa necklace debuts our goal of creat', 'Hanifa', array['Gold','Silver']::text[], '2022-08-12T18:14:54-04:00', array['imma-4']::text[], true, '2026-11-25T19:01:51.946930+00:00'),
